{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：16:51 2026-11-22 HKT<br/>發佈時間：16:51 2026-11-22 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：16:51 2026-11-22 HKT</p><img alt=\"「嘉應高昇」輕鬆大勝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/2425ab3c9d62caa00377469ac366d6eb/2026-11/r7_5.jpg\"/><p>今日沙田賽事編排三場二級賽，第一場馬會短途錦標，馬王「嘉應高昇」作遠征澳洲回港後首次上陣，臨場照例被捧成一倍全熱門，結果其演出沒有令捧場客失望，在潘頓胯下輕易以三又四分三馬位擊敗對手，奪得其服役以來第二十三場頭馬。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/960856f0dc4aa6cec9d097f52517ee9c/2026-11/3a176c7e-7bf6-40d4-9dc3-7d69e4509b25.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2f6f81affc2bb15452d6701516890f3b/2026-11/4d10eed8-00c2-4905-acf6-1e633d6d1c68.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bb176f8af34123ab8dd2ecddef3c4930/2026-11/5dd5dbb3-44ed-4c1e-89c5-3f9c559a376f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/89b5294c4384e30781c5b4ba038fb942/2026-11/006f4373-5a4a-4871-9e54-edde2a47891c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/358ca2c2460f4faa21aeb9efb5343542/2026-11/8c23335e-fbe4-4e1a-9827-306901fef53f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e7432360beaf539a6e3fe5786dbd46ec/2026-11/9a3eef4f-7ff5-43dc-9225-944488c7ca12.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9b32597756d875f1caaf1a487bea26f2/2026-11/027c802e-260f-461e-8871-5be87a01b25e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/30a444f0ba0dc014282d745abfe0565c/2026-11/30c02ed1-c140-4972-9cf2-ce7096e5c453.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/92630051598dafc2baab9b3c547685f8/2026-11/047d3050-12fa-4210-adc2-c7add497bc4d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a18dbe888f40df42bd4f378292fe5d5c/2026-11/049cf16c-2a37-44fe-b684-97c9b38f387b.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e6a534bfb9f20b10ba26f10a91fc2f80/2026-11/054eeda8-fe2c-4724-957f-e72c95f3940d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/185fc4818c23d958d0